The statute's retention rule states that records of the society are retained for the period named in the schedule of this statute[[cite:obs-5898b6c4944a3458c2a3d2f4a80fb5b7840ae59c "Records of the society are retained for the period named in the schedule of this statute."]]. According to the schedule, ledgers are kept for eleven calendar years before shredding[[cite:obs-1163d7fc38e1c542a262977580efb6e2554aac17 "Ledgers: eleven calendar years, shredding afterwards."]].